Recorded sound bank goes here. See docs/SOUNDS.md for the categories, the
filename pattern, and what each one should sound like.

Git doesn't track empty folders, so this file exists to keep the directory
in a fresh clone. main.py creates it anyway if it's missing — this is for
anyone reading the repo, not for the code.

Drop a .wav in and it replaces the synth placeholder for that category
automatically. Press R in-game to reload without restarting.
